# The API image is built from the repo root, because the API shares its game
# logic and item data with the frontend in src/. This is an allowlist: only
# what the API needs is sent to Docker, so secrets (.env), git history, the
# licensed music and the frontend never end up in an image by accident.
*
!server/
!src/utils/
!src/data/

# Installed inside the image instead, and local dev data never ships.
server/node_modules
server/data
